In the second case (Question 2), when select-
ing the Negative role, Proposal 1 submitted by one
model fully agrees with the Affirmative’s incorrect
reasoning and fails to provide new insights (shown
in red). Meta-Debate identifies this weakness (in
bold) and assigns a low score, as the proposal does
not fulfill the intended function of the Negative
role. In contrast, Proposal 2 generated by a differ-
